# My First Blog Post

This is my first blog post! You can write your thoughts, articles, and ideas here.

## How to structure your posts

- Use **markdown** formatting
- Add a front matter with `title`, `date`, and `draft: false`
- The post will automatically appear in your blog list

## Features

- Posts are sorted by date (newest first)
- Each post can be opened individually
- The aesthetics match your website theme

Happy blogging!
